@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ─── 1. Health Checks ───────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### ─── 2. Register Tenant & Admin User ───────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgName": "Acme Global",
  "email": "admin@acme.org",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "name": "Jane Doe"
}

# Copy the "access_token" value from response ↓
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@workspaceId = PASTE_WORKSPACE_ID_HERE

### ─── 3. Login ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.org",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### ─── 4. Current User & Workspaces ───────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 5. Refresh Session ────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### ─── 6. Upload Document (Multipart Form) ───────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Corporate Expense Policy 2026
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="expense_policy.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Corporate Expense Policy
Section 1. Travel expenses must be pre-approved by the department director.
Section 2. Hotel accommodations are capped at 250 dollars per night for domestic travel.
Section 3. Expense reimbursement requests must be submitted within 30 days of travel completion.
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### ─── 7. List Active Documents ───────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 8. Scoped Workspace Search ────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "hotel accommodation reimbursement",
  "mode": "hybrid",
  "limit": 5
}

### ─── 9. Grounded Q&A (Answers with Verifiable Citations) ────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the maximum hotel accommodation allowance per night?"
}

### ─── 10. Grounded Q&A (Abstention on Unsupported Questions) ─────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the recommended recipe for baking sourdough bread?"
}
